# Fetched source, build trees, and the libraries themselves. build/ffmpeg-<version>/ is FFmpeg's
# tree at the pinned commit, fetched by source.sh at build time — this repository is not a fork
# of FFmpeg and carries none of its source. Nothing built belongs in git either: the release
# assets are the artifacts, and a committed .a is one nobody can tell apart from the one CI made.
build/
dist/
.DS_Store

# The same rule, applied to the Rust half. `prebuilt/` is a cache: ./sync-prebuilt.sh fills it
# from dist/, and failing that the sys crate's build.rs downloads what it needs from the latest
# release. The directory itself is kept (an empty .gitkeep): build.rs watches it with
# rerun-if-changed, and a watched path that does not exist reruns the build script every time.
crates/libavcodec-hevc-prebuilt-sys/prebuilt/*
!crates/libavcodec-hevc-prebuilt-sys/prebuilt/.gitkeep
target/
Cargo.lock

# Per-checkout notes for Claude Code; anything that holds for everyone belongs in AGENTS.md.
CLAUDE.local.md

# Scratch for the Windows CI driver (ci/windows/remote.ps1 stages its upload here).
tmp/
